{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30590","headline":"和主司王起 · 蒯希逸","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一振声华入紫薇，三开秦镜照春闱。\n龙门旧列金章贵，莺谷新迁碧落飞。\n恩感风雷宜变化，诗裁锦绣借光辉。\n谁知散质多荣忝，鸳鹭清尘接布衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒯希逸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}